# LeanGioia.Basic

Shared definitions for the `lean-gioia` formalization project.

The first formalization target is the locality obstruction associated
with the W state: under the paper's extensive-locality hypotheses,
if the W state is an eigenstate then the vacuum state is also an
eigenstate.

This file is intentionally small. Domain-specific definitions should
be added only as required by the paper specification in `SPEC.md`.
